  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Note that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the distance between the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on argand plane.</p><p>Note that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the distance between the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on argand plane.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ba6c7191-3d0e-4094-b2a0-b7d1f2ccdec3-image.png\" style=\"width: 257px; height: 140px;\" />​​​​​​​</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is sum of distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For minimising the sum,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;should lie on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;should be&nbsp;equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&plusmn;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
